    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I set out to make a puzzle game but I kept adding more and more stuff I like until this popped out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I\u2019m not really a story or lore kinda guy, so there\u2019s none of that here. You\u2019re just a little round guy exploring a colourful world, solving logic puzzles, collecting stuff, and unlocking new areas as you go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s puzzle-first, but there\u2019s plenty to do between puzzles too. There's lots to explore and a few secrets to find if you\u2019re the curious type.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Platforming</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collecting stuff</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Getting upgrades</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Finding Secrets</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then you might like this.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I hope you do, but if not, thanks for checking it out anyway!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I set out to make a puzzle game but I kept adding more and more stuff I like until this popped out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I\u2019m not really a story or lore kinda guy, so there\u2019s none of that here. You\u2019re just a little round guy exploring a colourful world, solving logic puzzles, collecting stuff, and unlocking new areas as you go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s puzzle-first, but there\u2019s plenty to do between puzzles too. There's lots to explore and a few secrets to find if you\u2019re the curious type.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Platforming</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collecting stuff</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Getting upgrades</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Finding Secrets</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then you might like this.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I hope you do, but if not, thanks for checking it out anyway!</p>",
    "short_description": "Core Descent is a puzzle-platformer set in a vivid world filled with puzzles to solve, items to collect, and secrets to find.",
